{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01HNsstzHy6pmkkyLEJSmoTh","type":"tool_result","content":"178\tpub const fn sumcheck_round0_deg(l_skip: usize, d: usize) -> usize {\n179\t    d * ((1 << l_skip) - 1)\n180\t}\n181\t\n182\t/// `mat` is a matrix of the evaluations on hyperprism D_n of a prismalinear extensions of the\n183\t/// columns. We \"fold\" it by evaluating the prismalinear polynomials at `r` in the univariate\n184\t/// variable `Z`.\n185\t///\n186\t/// If `n < 0`, then we evaluate `mat` at `r^{-n}`, which is equivalent to folding the lift of\n187\t/// `mat`."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01FZzK86KrwWGG3hq5jAC3MR","session_id":"48b5d5bc-06ba-4812-85f4-27a650fcd6d2","uuid":"2c65ca0f-34d1-4373-911e-9e4fbd4f2dc6","timestamp":"2026-04-14T04:38:30.125Z"}
