valuation functions (lines 311-332):**\n```rust\nfn _logup_bary_eval_interactions_round0(\n    tmp_sums_buffer: *mut Frac<EF>,\n    output: *mut Frac<EF>,\n    selectors_cube: *const F,\n    preprocessed: *const F,\n    main_parts: *const *const F,\n    eq_cube: *const EF,\n    public_values: *const F,\n    numer_weights: *const EF,\n    denom_weights: *const EF,\n    denom_sum_init: EF,\n    d_rules: *const std::ffi::c_void,\n    rules_len: usize,\n    buffer_size: u32,\n    d_intermediates: *mut F,\n    skip_domain: u32,\n    num_x: u32,\n    height: u32,\n    num_cosets: u32,\n    g_shift: F,\n    max_temp_bytes: usize,\n) -> i32;\n```\n\n**Constraint evaluation (lines 351-367):**\n```rust\nfn _zerocheck_ntt_eval_constraints(\n    tmp_sums_buffer: *mut EF,\n    output: *mut EF,\n    selectors_cube: *const F,\n    preprocessed: *const F,\n    main_ptrs: *const *const F,\n    eq_cube: *const EF,\n    lambda_pows: *const EF,\n    public_values: *const F,\n    d_rules: *const std::ffi::c_void,\n    rules_len: usize,\n    d_used_nodes: *const usize,\n    used_nodes_len: usize,\n    lambda_len: usize,\n    buffer_size: u32,\n    d_intermediates: *mut F,\n    skip_domain: u32,\n    num_x: u32,\n    height: u32,\n    num_cosets: u32,\n    g_shift: F,\n    max_temp_bytes: usize,\n) -> i32;\n```\n\n**Safe Rust wrappers (lines 962-1058):**\n\n`zerocheck_ntt_eval_constraints` (lines 962-1005) wraps the raw extern and takes `&mut DeviceBuffer<EF>` for output and temp buffers.\n\n`logup_bary_eval_interactions_round0` (lines 1015-1058) wraps the raw extern and takes `&mut DeviceBuffer<Frac<EF>>` for tmp_sums and output.\n\n---\n\n### 4. **Build File Configuration**\n**File:** `/home/georg/stark-backend/crates/cuda-backend/build.rs` (lines 1-43)\n\n**Compiled .cu files** (from glob `cuda/src/**/*.cu`):\n- All .cu files in `cuda/src/` are automatically compiled\n- `bn254_poseidon2.cu` is only compiled if `CARGO_FEATURE_BABY_BEAR_BN254_POSEIDON2` is enabled\n\n**Existing logup_zer